    "citations": [
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00061",
        "explanation": "The doctor gave a concrete return-to-hospital plan with owner and same-day/next-morning timing.",
        "quote": "今天下午能去就去"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00110",
        "explanation": "The doctor gave a contingency plan if the patient still refused and required a documented next contact pathway.",
        "quote": "最迟何时回复、候补是否仍有效、下一次排期如何办理"
      },
      {
        "event_id": "lite_evt_00129",
        "explanation": "The last event shows a generally safe trajectory with consent signed and red flags monitored, but it is a family update/question that was not answered by the doctor.",
        "quote": "我现在就是想再确认一下"
      }
    ],
    "executable": true,
    "explanation": "The episode produced an executable plan and actual re-engagement with the hand-surgery pathway, including patient-signed consent, waiting-list/re-scheduling, contact information, and neurologic deterioration triggers. Closure remains questionable rather than fully valid because the doctor did not complete the case-required vascular red-flag screen or coagulation-name clarification, and the final family confirmation question was left unanswered.",
