          "quote": "由意识清楚、能理解并表达选择的患者本人决定并签字"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor addressed the family-as-proxy boundary and repeatedly explored/handled fear of anesthesia and postoperative plaster as reasons for refusal.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
