          "quote": "手无力近期明显加重、手指张合困难"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00110",
          "explanation": "The doctor again used neurologic deterioration as an urgent trigger, still without vascular screening.",
          "quote": "手指明显张不开或夹持突然明显变差"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "This is a minor/moderate responsibility-chain omission: the doctor screened rapid neurologic deterioration, but never asked about or gave triggers for cold/purple fingers, marked swelling/pain, skin tension, or capillary refill as required.",
      "issue_kind": "omission",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "minor_or_moderate_error"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
