          "explanation": "The doctor actively used the workspace to seek prior records, including surgery, anesthesia, tests, medications, and uploaded documents.",
          "quote": "手外科/骨科/神经科门诊与住院记录"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged the photo/document uncertainty and avoided giving a definitive remote surgical decision.",
          "quote": "单据照片看不清"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor used available records and consistently redirected definitive confirmation of operative indication, timing, and contraindications back to the original surgical team with original documents.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
